  "content": "\n\n你是否曾想過：「_為什麼準心這麼大？_」。如果是的話，這個材質包絕對是你的最佳選擇！\n\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/resourcepack/smallercrosshair\"><img src=\"https://github.com/intergrav/devins-badges/blob/v3/assets/cozy/available/modrinth_64h.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Modrinth\"></a> <a href=\"https://x.com/cr3lay\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/intergrav/devins-badges/refs/heads/v3/assets/cozy/social/twitter-singular_64h.png\" alt=\"Twitter\"></a> <a href=\"https://guns.lol/crelay\"><img src=\"https://images.guns.lol/1cdda87505111e7d02bc14dd6434d41bd00bdb1e/Z7q57F.png\" alt=\"socials\"></a> \n\n它會將準心縮小 1 個像素，適合希望在不移動 GUI 縮放的情況下調整準心大小的玩家。\n\n（與準心指示器模組相容）\n![差異](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/3030e7ec988aff730838cf2b8e6e6cfb18505590.png)",
